  "contentHtml": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>김석중선생님을 대신해서 전달합니다. &gt;&gt;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">안녕하세요 인천과학사랑 교사모임 김석중입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">제 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">22</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">회 인천과학사랑 교사모임 실험 연수 안내입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">연수신청 기간이 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">19</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">일 부터입니다</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"> </span></p><p style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">이번 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">22</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-fa